OL,3,A'We will never, ever forget,' Trump
OL,4,Asays as US marks 25th anniversary of
OL,5,A9/11
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says "we will never, ever
OL,8,Fforget" the victims of 9/11 as the US
OL,9,Fmarks the 25th anniversary of the
OL,10,Fattacks
OL,12,FTrump is attending a remembrance
OL,13,Fceremony in honour of the 184 people
OL,14,Fkilled at the Pentagon when American
OL,15,FAirlines Flight 77 crashed into the
OL,16,Fbuilding
OL,18,FIn New York, a memorial ceremony is
OL,19,Funder way at the site of the World
OL,20,FTrade Center - where about 2,700 died
OL,21,Fafter hijackers crashed two planes into
OL,22,Fthe Twin Towers
